- Cabinet approval was granted to refer the above Bill presented to the Cabinet by H.E. the President, in his capacity as the Minister of Finance and Planning, to the Cabinet Sub?Committee on Legislation for its recommendations, in the first instance.  The Bill intends to introduce amendments to the Regulation of Insurance Industry Act, to enable the following: 

